  AUTHORS   Manu Pereira,M.D., Ropero,P., Loureiro,C. and Vives Corrons,J.L.
  TITLE     Low affinity hemoglobinopathy (Hb Vigo) due to a new mutation of
            beta globin gene (c200 A>T; Lys>Ile). A cause of rare anemia
